 ’s steep Wall\, beginning around 7\,000 feet. Competitive runners\, kids
  and families are welcome\; proceeds benefit Big Bear High School Cross Co
 untry.\n\nWHEN\nSat\, Aug 15\, 2026 at 9:00 AM\n\nPRICE / ADMISSION\n• R
 egistration is open through the official Active.com link\, but no 2026 ent
 ry price is published\n• Free parking at Snow Summit\n• Entry includes
  a shirt and a free Scenic Sky Chair ride down\n\nSCHEDULE\n• Friday 4:0
 0–7:00 PM — advance packet pickup at Mystic Rose\n• Saturday before 
 the race — same-day packet pickup at Snow Summit\n• Saturday 9:00 AM 
 — published race start\; end time not confirmed\n\nWHAT TO EXPECT\n• P
 aid runners receive a shirt and a free Scenic Sky Chair ride down\n• Spe
 ctators may buy a discounted chair ticket up or hike Bobsled Trail for fre
 e\n• Awards span age 13-and-under through 70+\, plus teams\n• Free par
 king\n• The official page states registration is open and lists same-day
  pickup at Snow Summit before the race\, so a walk-up entry looks possible
 \n\nTBD / VERIFY BEFORE GOING\n• One official listing says 9:00 AM–noo
 n but its body says 9:00–10:00 AM\; the canonical page omits an end time
 \n• Registration is confirmed open and routes to Active.com\, but no 202
 6 entry price is published on any official page\n\nCONFLICTS / SAME-DAY OP
 TIONS\n• Overlaps or competes with: SkyFest Big Bear — Saturday (Sat\,
  Aug 15\, 2026\, 12:00 PM–11:00 PM).\n• Overlaps or competes with: Faw
 nskin Doo Dah Parade — 50th Anniversary (Sat\, Aug 15\, 2026\, 10:00 AM
 –3:00 PM).\n\nOFFICIAL SOURCES\n• Official event page: https://www.big
 bear.com/events/conquer-the-wall/\n• Official listing with conflicting t
 ime: https://www.bigbear.com/events/conquer-the-wall-5/\n\nCALENDAR STATUS
 : DETAILS_TBD\nLast checked: 2026-08-15\nDetails can change. Recheck the o
 fficial source before making a special trip.
