 ay-What-You-Can tickets are offered at $0\n\nSCHEDULE\n• 7:30 PM — cur
 tain\n• Approximately 9:30 PM — end\; the published runtime is two hou
 rs\n\nWHAT TO EXPECT\n• Big Bear Theatre Project describes the festival 
 as a celebration of original voices and brand-new stories developed locall
 y\n• The run covers August 13–16\; this is the Saturday-evening perfor
 mance\n• Wheelchair seating\, assisted listening devices and service ani
 mals are accommodated\n\nUSEFUL NOTES\n• The Pay-What-You-Can tier means
