 ican bands\, food and beer\, stein holding\, log sawing\, beer races\, a m
 echanical bull\, games and kids activities.\n\nWHEN\nFri\, Oct 30\, 2026\,
  5:00 PM–11:00 PM\n\nPRICE / ADMISSION\n• Ordinary adult general admis
 sion is $18.03 Sundays\, $28.68 Fridays/After Dark\, and about $28.68–$3
 9.33 Saturdays depending on date and entry time\n• Children age 12 and u
 nder are free Sundays\; other youth/senior prices vary by weekend\n• Pre
 ferred/VIP packages over $50 are intentionally not recommended\n\nSCHEDULE
 \n• September Saturdays: 1:00–11:00 PM\n• October Fridays: 5:00–11
 :00 PM\n• October Saturdays: 1:00 PM–midnight\n• All Sundays: noon
 –6:00 PM\; children’s contests around 3:00 PM\n• October 9\, 23 and 
 30: beer tasting 7:00–9:00 PM inside the festival\n\nWHAT TO EXPECT\n•
  Friday nights are indoors and lower-crowd\n• Saturday After Dark entry 
 begins at 7:30 PM\n• America’s Heroes weekends offer free general admi
 ssion to eligible military/veterans\, firefighters\, law enforcement and f
 rontline healthcare workers\n\nUSEFUL NOTES\n• Buy only the ordinary gen
 eral-admission tier unless the premium seating itself is worth the large s
 urcharge\n• Tickets are rain-or-shine\, date-specific and nonrefundable\
 n\nOFFICIAL SOURCES\n• Official dates\, hours and policies: https://bigb
 earevents.com/oktoberfest/tickets-3/\n• Official 2026 pricing and festiv
 al overview: https://www.bigbear.com/events/oktoberfest/\n• Official ent
